        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐψύχει</span>
			<i>farewell</i>! a common inscr.  on tombs, <i><span class="en">
